# Shared

The one shape both halves of this app agree on.

Declaring it ONCE is what makes the wire a contract rather than two hand-written
serialisers that agree until they don't: the server answers `Seq of Todo` and the
page asks for `Seq of Todo`, and the JSON in between is DERIVED from this block —
`toJsonSeq_Todo` on the way out, `fromJsonSeq_Todo` on the way back. Nobody writes
a serialiser, and nobody can forget to update one.

## A Todo has:
    an id, which is Int.
    a text, which is Text.
    a done, which is Bool.
